  <Id>k__BackingField: console_flap
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 14
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 2
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: 75
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 1
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 3
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: 'Console: Flap Dash'
  <Description>k__BackingField: Tap to flap your little bird through the gaps between
    the pipes. It gets faster the longer you last.
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9168c722b1c97474c9c8c154d17de69c, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - 'Tap, don''t hold: each tap is one flap'
  - The first tap starts your run
  - Crash and you restart - only your best run counts
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Fly through as many pipes as you can.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Touching a pipe or the ground ends the run.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Pipes passed in your best run; everyone gets the same
    pipes.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - SPACE|Flap
  - W|Flap
